{"sha": "76503f00cea4ca426b4e2582beab5c51f791493d9cf93fa73e71854db20b233e", "body": ["\\begin{remark}", "记忆口诀：正弦值依次为", "$\\frac{\\sqrt0}{2}, \\frac{\\sqrt1}{2}, \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}, \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2},", "\\frac{\\sqrt4}{2}$，余弦值则为该数列的逆序。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{诱导公式}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[诱导公式]\\label{prop:g11:trigo:associated}", "\\index{诱导公式}", "对任意 $t \\in \\R$：", "\\[", "\\begin{aligned}", "\\cos(-t) &= \\cos t, & \\sin(-t) &= -\\sin t,\\\\", "\\cos(\\pi - t) &= -\\cos t, & \\sin(\\pi - t) &= \\sin t,\\\\", "\\cos(\\pi + t) &= -\\cos t, & \\sin(\\pi + t) &= -\\sin t,\\\\", "\\cos\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2} - t\\right) &= \\sin t, &", "\\sin\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2} - t\\right) &= \\cos t .", "\\end{aligned}", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "每一行都表示圆的一种对称性。", "", "$M(-t)$ 是 $M(t)$ 关于 $x$ 轴的对称点：横坐标", "不变，纵坐标变号。", "", "$M(\\pi - t)$ 是 $M(t)$ 关于 $y$ 轴的对称点：", "从 $\\pi$ 出发反向走 $t$ 所到之点，与从 $0$ 出发", "正向走 $t$ 所到之点水平方向相反。横坐标变号，纵坐标", "不变。", "", "$M(\\pi + t)$ 是 $M(t)$ 的对径点（转过半周）：两个", "坐标都变号。", "", "$M\\!\\left(\\frac\\pi2 - t\\right)$ 是 $M(t)$ 关于", "直线 $y = x$ 的对称点，交换了两个坐标。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=2.0]", "  \\draw[->] (-1.35,0) -- (1.45,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-1.35) -- (0,1.45) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\draw[gray] (0,0) circle (1);", "  \\fill (40:1) circle (0.7pt) node[above right, font=\\small] {$M(t)$};", "  \\fill (-40:1) circle (0.7pt) node[below right, font=\\small] {$M(-t)$};", "  \\fill (140:1) circle (0.7pt) node[above left, font=\\small]", "    {$M(\\pi - t)$};", "  \\fill (220:1) circle (0.7pt) node[below left, font=\\small]", "    {$M(\\pi + t)$};", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (40:1) -- (-40:1);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (40:1) -- (140:1);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (140:1) -- (220:1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (0,0) -- (40:1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (0,0) -- (140:1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (0,0) -- (220:1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (0,0) -- (-40:1);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 四个相关点：$M(-t)$ 与 $M(t)$ 关于", "$x$ 轴对称，$M(\\pi - t)$ 关于 $y$ 轴对称，$M(\\pi + t)$", "则与之互为对径点。\\cref{prop:g11:trigo:associated}中的每一恒等式，", "均可由此图读出。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{3} = \\cos\\left(\\pi - \\frac\\pi3\\right)", "= -\\cos\\frac\\pi3 = -\\frac12$，且", "$\\sin\\frac{7\\pi}{6} = \\sin\\left(\\pi + \\frac\\pi6\\right)", "= -\\sin\\frac\\pi6 = -\\frac12$。五个值的表格经", "对称性推广后，便覆盖整个圆周。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{解三角方程}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[方程 $\\cos t = \\cos a$ 与 $\\sin t = \\sin a$]", "\\label{thm:g11:trigo:equations}", "对实数 $t$ 与 $a$：", "\\[", "\\cos t = \\cos a \\iff t = a + 2k\\pi \\ \\text{或}\\ t = -a + 2k\\pi", "\\quad (k \\in \\Z),", "\\]", "\\[", "\\sin t = \\sin a \\iff t = a + 2k\\pi \\ \\text{或}\\ t = \\pi - a + 2k\\pi", "\\quad (k \\in \\Z).", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "单位圆上两点的横坐标相同，当且仅当它们", "相等，或关于 $x$ 轴互为对称点。由", "\\cref{prop:g11:trigo:associated}可知，$M(a)$ 的对称点为 $M(-a)$。于是", "$\\cos t = \\cos a$ 意味着 $M(t) = M(a)$ 或 $M(t) = M(-a)$，即\\", "$t = \\pm a$（差 $2\\pi$ 的整数倍）。类似地，纵坐标相等时，", "两点相同，或关于 $y$ 轴互为对称点，而", "$M(a)$ 的对称点为 $M(\\pi - a)$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[在区间上解 $\\cos t = c$]\\label{met:g11:trigo:solve}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由已知值表，求出\\emph{一个}角 $a$，", "        使 $\\cos a = c$。", "  \\item 写出通解 $t = \\pm a + 2k\\pi$", "        （见\\cref{thm:g11:trigo:equations}）。", "  \\item 选取使解落在所给区间内的整数 $k$，", "        并列出相应的解。", "\\end{enumerate}", "对 $\\sin t = c$ 类似处理，其中 $t = a + 2k\\pi$ 或", "$t = \\pi - a + 2k\\pi$。", "\\end{method}", ""]}